---
// The physical-media problem + before/after.
---

<section class="section problem">
  <div class="container problem__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Why now</span>
      <h2>Tapes fade. Discs fail. Photos curl in the heat.</h2>
      <p class="problem__text">
        Most families have decades of memories sitting in boxes — on formats that are slowly
        breaking down and players nobody owns anymore. Every year they wait, a little more is lost.
      </p>
      <dl class="stats">
        <div><dt>10–25 yrs</dt><dd>typical life of a VHS tape before quality drops</dd></div>
        <div><dt>No player</dt><dd>most homes can't play tapes or reels anymore</dd></div>
        <div><dt>1 copy</dt><dd>most family memories exist in a single fragile copy</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="compare" aria-label="Before and after Memory Portal">
      <div class="compare__side compare__side--before">
        <p class="compare__label">Before</p>
        <div class="box">
          <span class="box__item box__item--tape">VHS · 1998</span>
          <span class="box__item box__item--disc">Wedding DVD</span>
          <span class="box__item box__item--photo">Loose photos</span>
          <span class="box__item box__item--tape2">Hi8 · Trip</span>
        </div>
        <p class="compare__caption">A box in the attic. Unlabelled. Unwatched.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compare__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <div class="compare__side compare__side--after">
        <p class="compare__label">After</p>
        <div class="mini-portal">
          <div class="mini-portal__row"><span class="photo tone-a"></span><div><b>1998 · Wedding</b><small>Video · 2h 14m</small></div></div>
          <div class="mini-portal__row"><span class="photo tone-c"></span><div><b>2003 · Family Trip</b><small>48 photos · 1 video</small></div></div>
          <div class="mini-portal__row"><span class="photo tone-d"></span><div><b>2007 · Birthdays</b><small>112 photos</small></div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="compare__caption">A family timeline. Searchable. Shared with everyone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: var(--mp-space-8);
    align-items: center;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--mp-text-3xl);
    margin-top: var(--mp-space-3);
  }
  .problem__text {
    margin-top: var(--mp-space-4);
    font-size: var(--mp-text-lg);
    color: var(--mp-muted);
  }
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--mp-space-4);
    margin: var(--mp-space-6) 0 0;
  }
  .stats div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: var(--mp-space-4);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-top: var(--mp-space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mp-line);
  }
  .stats dt {
    font-family: var(--mp-font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--mp-gold-deep);
  }
  .stats dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mp-charcoal-soft);
  }
  .compare {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--mp-space-4);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .compare__side {
    padding: var(--mp-space-5);
    border-radius: var(--mp-radius-lg);
  }
  .compare__side--before {
    background: #e7dfd3;
    filter: saturate(0.6);
  }
  .compare__side--after {
    background: var(--mp-warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--mp-line);
    box-shadow: var(--mp-shadow-md);
  }
  .compare__label {
    font-size: var(--mp-text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mp-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--mp-space-3);
  }
  .compare__side--after .compare__label {
    color: var(--mp-gold-deep);
  }
  .compare__arrow {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--mp-gold);
  }
  .compare__caption {
    margin-top: var(--mp-space-4);
    font-size: var(--mp-text-sm);
    color: var(--mp-charcoal-soft);
  }
  .box {
    position: relative;
    height: 190px;
    background: #c9b597;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 -30px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }
  .box__item {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #f2ebdf;
    background: #3b3530;
  }
  .box__item--tape { top: 22px; left: 14px; transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  .box__item--disc { top: 70px; right: 14px; transform: rotate(6deg); background: #8a8178; }
  .box__item--photo { bottom: 26px; left: 30px; transform: rotate(4deg); background: #efe6d6; color: #4a443d; }
  .box__item--tape2 { bottom: 60px; right: 40px; transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .mini-portal {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--mp-space-3);
  }
  .mini-portal__row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--mp-space-3);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .mini-portal__row .photo {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .mini-portal__row b {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--mp-font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .mini-portal__row small {
    color: var(--mp-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .problem__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .compare {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .compare__arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      justify-self: center;
    }
  }
</style>
